RESEARCH DISCIPLINE

Mechanical fake-world validation
must pass twice byte-identically
before F49.

Focused parent parity
must show:

BASE
equals A45 ECHO_PHASE.

With challenge fields forced to zero,
each treatment must also
reduce exactly to BASE.

F49 must exist
before primary worlds are derived.

No post-result:

gain;

radius;

mode rule;

field normalization;

arm;

